    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Xisqiyaah Oo Daahiriyey Macbudkii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xisqiyaah markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray shan iyo labaatan sannadood, oo Yeruusaalemna boqor buu ku ahaa sagaal iyo labaatan sannadood, oo hooyadiis magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Abiiyaah ina Sekaryaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga hortiisa ku qumman, sidii dhammaan awowgiis Daa'uud sameeyey oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sannaddii kowaad oo boqornimadiisa bisheedii kowaad ayuu albaabbadii gurigii Rabbiga furay, wuuna cusboonaysiiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawina wuu soo geliyey, oo wuxuu iyagii ku soo wada ururshay meesha bannaan oo dhinaca bari ku taal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu iyagii ku yidhi, Reer Laawiyow, i maqla, oo haddeer isdaahiriya, oo waxaad kaloo daahirisaan guriga Rabbiga ah Ilaahii awowayaashiin, oo nijaastana ka bixiya meesha quduuska ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, awowayaasheen way xadgudbeen, oo waxay sameeyeen wax shar ah Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ah hortiisa, oo isagii way ka tageen, oo wejigoodiina way ka sii jeediyeen rugtii Rabbiga, oo waxay u jeediyeen dhabarkooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxay xidheen albaabbadii balbalada, oo laambadihiina way demiyeen, oo Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iilna meeshii quduuska ahayd foox uguma ay shidin, oo qurbaanno la gubona uguma ay bixin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taas daraaddeed ayaa cadhada Rabbigu ugu soo degtay dadka Yahuudah iyo Yeruusaalemba, oo Rabbiguna wuxuu iyagii geliyey rabshad iyo in laga yaabo oo lagu foodhyo, sida aad idinkuba indhihiinna ugu aragtaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, bal eega, awowayaasheen seef bay ku le'deen, oo wiilasheennii iyo gabdhaheennii iyo dumarkeenniiba waxaa loo haystaa maxaabiis, waana taas daraaddeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba waxaa qalbigayga ku jirta inaan axdi la dhigto Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil, si ay cadhadiisa kululu inooga noqoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashaydiiyow, haddaba adeegiddiinna ha dayacina, maxaa yeelay, Rabbigu wuxuu idiin doortay inaad hortiisa istaagtaan oo aad isaga u adeegtaan, oo aad midiidinno u ahaataan, oo aad foox u shiddaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa kuwii reer Laawi waxaa ka dhex kacay Maxad ina Camaasay, iyo Yoo'eel ina Casaryaah oo ahaa reer Qohaad, oo reer Meraariina waxaa ka kacay Qiish ina Cabdii, iyo Casaryaah ina Yehaleleel, oo reer Gershoonna waxaa ka kacay Yoo'aax ina Simmaah, iyo Ceeden ina Yoo'aax. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Eliisaafaanna waxaa ka kacay Shimrii iyo Yecuu'eel, oo reer Aasaafna waxaa ka kacay Sekaryaah iyo Matanyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Heemaanna waxaa ka kacay Yexii'eel iyo Shimcii, oo reer Yeduutuunna waxaa ka kacay Shemacyaah iyo Cusii'eel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay soo wada ururiyeen walaalahood, oo intay isdaahiriyeen ayay guriga Rabbiga u galeen inay nadiifiyaan si waafaqsan amarkii boqorka ee ahaa erayadii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadiina waxay galeen meeshii guriga Rabbiga ugu hoosaysay inay nadiifiyaan, oo wasakhdii ay macbudka Rabbiga gudihiisa ka heleen oo dhan waxay isugu wada keeneen barxaddii guriga Rabbiga. Markaasaa kuwii reer Laawi qaadeen oo waxay geeyeen durdurka Qidroon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba iyagu waxay isdaahirinta bilaabeen bishii kowaad maalinteedii kowaad, oo isla bishaas maalinteedii siddeedaad ayay yimaadeen balbaladii Rabbiga, oo guriga Rabbigana waxay ku daahiriyeen siddeed maalmood, oo hawshaas waxay dhammeeyeen bishii kowaad maalinteedii lix iyo tobnaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Boqor Xisqiyaah ugu galeen gurigiisii boqornimada oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Waannu wada nadiifinnay gurigii Rabbiga oo dhan, iyo meeshii qurbaanka la gubo, iyo weelasheedii oo dhan, iyo miiskii la saari jiray kibistii tusniinta iyo weelashiisii oo dhanba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Boqor Aaxaas intuu boqor ahaa weelashii uu xoorxooray markuu xadgudbay dhammaantood waannu wada diyaarinnay oo waannu daahirinnay, oo bal eeg, waxay hor yaalliin meesha allabariga ee Rabbiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Boqor Xisqiyaah wakhti hore kacay oo intuu soo wada urursaday amiirradii magaalada ayuu kor ugu baxay gurigii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay keeneen toddoba dibi, iyo toddoba wan, iyo toddoba baraar ah, iyo toddoba orgi, inay qurbaan dembi u ahaadaan boqortooyada aawadeed iyo meesha quduuska ah aawadeed iyo dadka Yahuudah aawadood. Oo wuxuu wadaaddadii reer Haaruun ku amray inay xoolahaas ku bixiyaan meesha Rabbiga lagu baryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay dibidii gowraceen oo intay wadaaddadii dhiiggii soo qaadeen ayay meesha allabariga ku rusheeyeen, oo haddana waxay gowraceen wanankii, oo dhiiggoodiina way ku rusheeyeen meesha allabariga, baraarkiina way gowraceen, oo dhiiggoodiina meesha allabariga ayay ku rusheeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo orgidii qurbaanka dembiga ahaydna boqorkii iyo shirkii hortooda ayay u soo dhoweeyeen, oo gacmahoodii ayay korka ka saareen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "markaasaa wadaaddadii orgidii gowraceen oo waxay dhiiggoodii dembi qurbaankiis kaga dhigeen meesha allabariga korkeeda si ay dadka Israa'iil oo dhan kafaaraggud ugu sameeyaan aawadeed, waayo, boqorka ayaa amray in qurbaanka la gubo iyo qurbaanka dembigaba loo wada sameeyo dadka Israa'iil oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii reer Laawina wuxuu soo taagay gurigii Rabbiga gudihiisa iyagoo haysta suxuun laysku garaaco iyo shareerado iyo kataarado, siduu ahaa amarkii Daa'uud iyo amarkii Gaad oo ahaa waxarkihii boqorka, iyo amarkii Nebi Naataan, waayo, amarku wuxuu ka yimid Rabbiga xaggiisa, oo nebiyadiisii buu u soo dhiibay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa reer Laawi waxay istaageen iyagoo haysta alaabtii muusikada oo Daa'uud, oo wadaaddadiina waxay istaageen iyagoo haysta turumbooyin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xisqiyaahna wuxuu amray in qurbaanka la gubo meesha allabariga lagu dul bixiyo. Oo markii qurbaanka la gubo bixintiisa la bilaabay waxaa kaloo la bilaabay gabaygii ahaa ammaanta Rabbiga, iyo turumbooyinkii, iyo alaabtii muusikada oo Daa'uud oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo shirkii oo dhammuna Ilaah bay caabudeen, oo raggii gabayaaga ahaana way gabyeen, oo kuwii turumbada watayna way ka dhawaajiyeen; oo waxaas oo dhammuna way sii socdeen tan iyo ilaa qurbaankii la gubayay ka dhammaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay dhammeeyeen qurbaanka bixintiisii ayaa boqorkii iyo kuwii isaga la joogay oo dhammu wada foororsadeen oo Ilaah caabudeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Boqor Xisqiyaah iyo amiirradii ayaa reer Laawi ku amreen inay Rabbiga ammaan ugu gabyaan erayadii Daa'uud iyo kuwii Aasaaf kii wax arkaha ahaa. Oo waxay ammaan ku gabyeen iyagoo faraxsan, oo intay madaxa foororiyeen ayay Ilaah caabudeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Xisqiyaah jawaabay oo yidhi, Hadda idinku waxaad quduus isaga dhigteen Rabbiga, haddaba soo dhowaada oo guriga Rabbiga waxaad soo gelisaan allabaryo iyo qurbaanno mahadnaqid ah. Kolkaasaa shirkii soo gesheen allabaryo iyo qurbaanno mahadnaqid ah, oo in alla intii qalbigoodu raalli ahaana waxay keeneen qurbaanno la gubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qurbaannadii la gubayay oo shirku keenayna tiradoodu waxay ahayd toddobaatan dibi, iyo boqol wan, iyo laba boqol oo baraar ah, oo intaasoo dhanna waxaa Rabbiga loogu keenay qurbaanno la gubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xoolihii la daahiriyeyna waxay ahaayeen lix boqol oo dibi iyo saddex kun oo ido ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse wadaaddadu aad bay u yaraayeen oo ma ay wada qali karin qurbaannadii la gubayay oo dhan, sidaas daraaddeed waxaa iyagii caawiyey walaalahoodii reer Laawi ilaa uu shuqulkii dhammaaday oo ay wadaaddadiina isdaahiriyeen, waayo, reer Laawi way ka qalbi toosnaayeen wadaaddada inay isdaahiriyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba qurbaannadii la gubayay iyo baruurtii qurbaannadii nabaadiinada, iyo qurbaannadii cabniinka oo la socday qurbaan kastoo la guboba aad bay u badnaayeen. Sidaasay hawshii guriga Rabbiga loo hagaajiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Xisqiyaah iyo dadkii oo dhammuba aad bay ugu reyreeyeen wixii Ilaah dadka u diyaariyey aawadood, waayo, xaalkaas waxaa lagu sameeyey si kedis ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
